<title>USA: May Department Stores Co Q3 Nov 2 net up.</title>
<headline>May Department Stores Co Q3 Nov 2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	 $0.44		    $0.41</p>
<p> Oper net		 116,000		  110,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,772,000		2,483,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     264,500		  265,300</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings for year-ago period, ended October 28, 1995, exclude $25.0 million or $0.09 a share in income from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Revenues reflect net retail sales.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	 $1.21		    $1.13</p>
<p> Oper net		 326,000		  304,000</p>
<p> Revs		   7,635,000		6,850,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     265,300		  264,900</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Current nine-month period earnings from continuing operations exclude income from discontinued operations of $11.0 million or $0.04. Year-ago earnings from continuing operations exclude income from discontinued operations of $86.0 million or $0.32 a share.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
